| Element | Token |
|---------|-------|
| Card Background | `warmCharcoal` / `cream` |
| Corner Radius | `CornerRadius.xl` (24pt) |
| Padding | `Spacing.md` (16pt) |
| Calorie Font | `MonchFont.largeTitle` |
| Macro Font | `MonchFont.headline` |
| Micro Font | `MonchFont.subheadline` |
